Infectious diseases or dangerous animals that can injure or kill people with their own power are usually not described as disasters.
Shopping at duty-free shops offers the opportunity to purchase goods without paying taxes and customs duties in certain locations.
Limiting travelers' purchases in countries with high taxes can sometimes lead to significant savings, especially for products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco.
