It is especially popular among those who have just left school, allowing them to take a year off before university without jeopardizing their studies.
In many cases, enrolling in a gap-year program abroad can actually enhance your chances of receiving higher education upon returning to your home country.
Usually, tuition fees are charged for enrollment in these training programs.
Finland is an excellent destination for canoeing. This "Land of a Thousand Lakes" also features thousands of islands in its lakes and coastal peninsulas.
You don't necessarily need a pleasure boat in these archipelagos and lakes.
Although coastal lagoons and larger lakes are big enough for sailboats, smaller boats and even rowboats provide a different experience.
